  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds validate compatibility --get-baseline-symbols with an optional NuGet feed URL.\n      Downloads latest stable baseline symbols from Microsoft AppSourceSymbols or a private feed,\n      validates app identities, and cleans up temporary packages. Improves spacing between baseline\n      download output and Business Central artifact details. CHANGELOG.md contains the complete details.",
